# Leaves next to a moving log (pareto-mid): DA (leaves at the log's rest cell) pulses k4..k6 on the
# on flip and k6..k8 on the off flip; DB (leaves at the cell it moves into) the other way round.
# An observer on the moved cell itself would pulse k3..k5 on both flips: the leaves shift it by
# -1 / +1 depending on which side they touch and which flip it is (used by mp8-leafU, mp7-leafC).
design designs/gadgets/log-leaves.txt
probe DA 2 1 -3
probe DB 3 1 3
use 0 1 0
expect_trace DA 000++00000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace DA 00000++000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace DB 00000++000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace DB 000++00000
